BACKLOG.md:593:  - Symptom: the spec declares the 200 body as `{ valid, revoked?, expired?, reason? }`, but the handler returns `{ verified, result }` (and always has). A response_schema_conformance check on this op would flag the missing required `valid`. Same applies to `POST /api/presentations/verify`, which shares `VcVerifyResponseSchema`.
BACKLOG.md:596:  - DECIDED 2026-07-16 (Kam): align the spec to the runtime (`{verified, result}`) — zero consumer breakage. Applies to both `POST /api/credentials/verify` and `POST /api/presentations/verify` (shared schema). Implementation pending (spec change + regen).
